{"id": "under-ten-million-then-amended", "title": "Contracts set just under the $10M Board line, then amended far past it", "seconds": 154.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "71521799559ac852", "words": 486, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For the contracts in this review, the Charter set the Board’s spending threshold at 10 million dollars.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.39, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes at $10 million or more"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "Charter section 9.118"}, "emph": ["10 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.0, 0.09, 0.48, 0.55, 0.7, 1.2, 1.3, 1.64, 1.8, 1.9, 2.22, 2.57, 3.1, 3.24, 3.42, 3.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Other approval rules could also apply.", "t0": 4.51, "t1": 6.27, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes at $10 million or more"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "Charter section 9.118"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.86, 1.13, 1.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "So how many City contracts sit just under that line,", "t0": 6.39, "t1": 9.79, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Just under the line", "sub": "$9.5 million to $9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.37, 0.58, 0.86, 1.56, 1.94, 2.33, 2.73, 3.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "within half a million of it?", "t0": 9.79, "t1": 11.44, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Just under the line", "sub": "$9.5 million to $9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.57, 0.64, 1.0, 1.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "364.", "t0": 11.44, "t1": 14.0, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "364", "label": "contracts from $9.5M to just under $10M"}, "emph": ["364"], "wt": [0.04, 1.52, 1.83]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 14.52, "t1": 16.11, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.14, 0.27, 0.35, 0.46, 0.95, 1.08, 1.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "And just over the line, up to 10.5 million? Only 39.", "t0": 16.23, "t1": 19.94, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "emph": ["39"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.4, 0.58, 0.68, 1.07, 1.21, 1.33, 1.47, 1.72, 1.88, 2.63, 2.94]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Different types of purchases could explain part of that gap.", "t0": 20.06, "t1": 22.38, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.42, 0.55, 0.93, 1.1, 1.53, 1.68, 1.81, 2.02]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Nine times as many land below.", "t0": 22.5, "t1": 24.44, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "emph": ["Nine times"], "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.64, 0.8, 1.15, 1.52]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "amount"], "text": "23 contracts sit at exactly 9,999,999 dollars.", "t0": 24.56, "t1": 27.77, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,999,999", "label": "the amount on 23 City contracts", "sub": "one dollar under the Board line"}, "emph": ["23"], "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 1.07, 1.33, 1.52, 1.98, 2.25, 2.43, 2.72]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[20]"], "text": "Two police vehicle contracts started the same day, each capped at 9.85 million dollars.", "t0": 28.29, "t1": 32.83, "shot": "pair0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "paired25", "kicker": "Same supplier and start date", "text": "Two police vehicle contracts. Each ceiling was $9.85 million.", "mark": "$9.85 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.79, 1.37, 1.62, 1.72, 1.98, 2.31, 2.5, 2.78, 2.89, 3.06, 3.36, 3.51, 3.71, 4.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[20]"], "text": "The ledger cannot show whether they covered overlapping work.", "t0": 32.95, "t1": 35.52, "shot": "pair1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "The two contracts", "sub": "Compare their scopes and invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.34, 0.68, 0.93, 1.25, 1.39, 1.67, 2.28]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "In July 2025,", "t0": 35.74, "t1": 37.1, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.73]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "the homelessness department signed DISH SF for one year:", "t0": 37.1, "t1": 40.11, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.17, 0.59, 1.11, 1.41, 1.81, 2.07, 2.27, 2.51, 2.66]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "9,995,897 dollars.", "t0": 40.11, "t1": 41.45, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "emph": ["9,995,897"], "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.5, 0.79]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "Eleven months later, the Board raised it. To what?", "t0": 41.57, "t1": 44.19, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-07-01", "to": "2026-06-05", "days": "339", "fromLab": "signed under the line", "toLab": "Board raises it", "kicker": "The first lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.55, 0.94, 1.09, 1.36, 1.69, 2.13, 2.24]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "25.4 million dollars.", "t0": 44.19, "t1": 46.96, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,361,109", "label": "Resolution 321-26"}, "emph": ["25.4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.89, 1.29, 1.63, 2.21]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[3]"], "text": "How did it fit under? Its cushion for overruns was 8.4 percent. The department’s standard is 15.", "t0": 47.48, "t1": 53.67, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["DISH SF contingency", "about 8.4%"], "b": ["the department’s standard", "15%"]}, "emph": ["8.4 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.23, 0.36, 0.51, 1.21, 1.5, 1.82, 1.99, 2.59, 2.81, 2.98, 3.28, 3.44, 3.97, 4.37, 5.05, 5.37, 5.65]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "At 15 percent, it would have needed a Board vote from day one.", "t0": 53.79, "t1": 56.6, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["DISH SF contingency", "about 8.4%"], "b": ["the department’s standard", "15%"]}, "emph": ["day one"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.52, 1.02, 1.08, 1.16, 1.3, 1.53, 1.63, 1.85, 2.09, 2.25, 2.48]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "St. Vincent de Paul runs the Division Circle Navigation Center.", "t0": 56.82, "t1": 59.73, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Division Circle Navigation Center", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "St. Vincent de Paul Society of SF"}, "wt": [0.09, 0.3, 0.56, 0.67, 0.99, 1.22, 1.3, 1.65, 1.98, 2.51]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "It costs about 8 million dollars a year, built to run ten years.", "t0": 59.85, "t1": 62.92, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Division Circle Navigation Center", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "St. Vincent de Paul Society of SF"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.37, 0.6, 0.7, 1.02, 1.32, 1.43, 1.82, 2.01, 2.12, 2.39, 2.65]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Its first contract covered one year, at 9,546,685 dollars.", "t0": 63.04, "t1": 66.45, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "One year, options through June 2035", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$9,546,685"}, "emph": ["one year"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.44, 0.83, 1.16, 1.31, 1.68, 1.77, 2.02, 2.18, 2.49, 2.63, 2.98]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The Board voted once the operator was in place.", "t0": 66.57, "t1": 69.23, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "One year, options through June 2035", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$9,546,685"}, "wt": [0.13, 0.34, 0.66, 0.94, 1.17, 1.26, 1.67, 1.86, 2.01]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[4]"], "text": "37.1 million dollars.", "t0": 69.35, "t1": 71.96, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$37.1 million", "label": "Resolution 322-26, June 5, 2026"}, "emph": ["37.1"], "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 0.95, 1.28, 1.94]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[7]"], "text": "Abode Services has a ceiling of 9,999,999 dollars.", "t0": 72.58, "t1": 75.39, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Abode Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Fiscal Agent - Prevention", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.77, 0.9, 0.98, 1.38, 1.51, 1.77, 1.91, 2.26]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[7]"], "text": "What did the department budget under it?", "t0": 75.51, "t1": 76.98, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Abode Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Fiscal Agent - Prevention", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.19, 0.27, 0.68, 1.0, 1.24]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "16.1 million dollars.", "t0": 76.98, "t1": 78.76, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,127,661", "label": "budgeted, FY2023-24 to FY2026-27"}, "emph": ["16.1"], "wt": [0.04, 0.56, 0.86, 0.95, 1.3]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Spending planned past the line, under a cap one dollar below it.", "t0": 79.28, "t1": 82.15, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Planned past the line", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "$29,062,174 requested on Oct 1, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.65, 0.84, 1.01, 1.38, 1.64, 1.74, 1.99, 2.18, 2.45, 2.72]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation was signed without bidding while on the Controller’s watch list.", "t0": 82.37, "t1": 86.94, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation", "sub": "$9,989,926, Controller Tier 3"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Conard House", "sub": "$9,997,681, newly Tier 2"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "No bidding", "sub": "Administrative Code Chapter 21B"}], "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.16, 0.36, 0.63, 0.9, 1.44, 1.64, 1.96, 2.31, 2.72, 3.12, 3.27, 3.37, 3.9, 4.18]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Conard House, also unbid, joined the list that December.", "t0": 87.06, "t1": 90.31, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation", "sub": "$9,989,926, Controller Tier 3"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Conard House", "sub": "$9,997,681, newly Tier 2"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "No bidding", "sub": "Administrative Code Chapter 21B"}], "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.87, 1.21, 1.87, 2.17, 2.28, 2.53, 2.73]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "At a Board hearing, the analyst reports that status. Under the line, that step was skipped.", "t0": 90.43, "t1": 94.93, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The step that was skipped", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "a contractor’s monitoring status, reported at a Board hearing"}, "emph": ["skipped"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.2, 0.46, 0.84, 0.94, 1.34, 1.71, 1.9, 2.54, 2.85, 2.96, 3.38, 3.75, 4.0, 4.14]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]"], "text": "In November, the Board adopted Conard House’s rise; Bayview’s is listed as passed, Abode’s pending.", "t0": 95.05, "t1": 100.46, "shot": "b19a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Conard House, File 26-1043, adopted Nov 3, 2026", "sub": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation listed as passed; Abode Services pending in committee", "chip": "$32,803,756"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.48, 0.57, 0.78, 1.18, 1.5, 1.88, 2.72, 3.11, 3.25, 3.6, 3.79, 4.6, 4.99]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[14]"], "text": "The Board’s analyst recommended counting amendments together in 2011.", "t0": 100.68, "t1": 103.97, "shot": "record-14-2011", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ov11co", "text": "2011", "mark": "2011", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.71, 1.17, 1.51, 1.99, 2.51, 2.63, 2.86]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[15]"], "text": "The first Richmond Area Multi Services agreement ran for 18 months.", "t0": 104.09, "t1": 107.26, "shot": "record-15-$9,862,750", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "u25h", "text": "$9,862,750", "mark": "$9,862,750", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.02, 0.33, 0.7, 1.02, 1.34, 1.73, 2.08, 2.28, 2.47, 2.81]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[16]"], "text": "An amendment took the syringe services agreement just below the threshold.", "t0": 107.38, "t1": 110.42, "shot": "record-16-$9,839,487", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "u25f", "text": "$9,839,487", "mark": "$9,839,487", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.4, 0.58, 0.69, 1.0, 1.4, 1.83, 2.14, 2.38, 2.48]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[18]"], "text": "The Airport sought advance authority to raise a contract by later modifications.", "t0": 110.54, "t1": 114.42, "shot": "record-18-$14 million to $60 million", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bd25i", "text": "$14 million to $60 million", "mark": "$14 million to $60 million", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.45, 0.74, 1.19, 1.61, 1.79, 2.05, 2.13, 2.59, 2.72, 3.0]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[19]"], "text": "A transit tire lease also came just below the threshold.", "t0": 114.54, "t1": 117.08, "shot": "record-19-$9,995,000", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bd25k", "text": "$9,995,000", "mark": "$9,995,000", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.45, 0.72, 1.05, 1.32, 1.57, 1.77, 1.95, 2.05]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[21]", "established[22]"], "text": "On HealthRIGHT360, the Board adopted a lower ceiling after the analyst reviewed actual spending.", "t0": 117.2, "t1": 121.54, "shot": "five-year-ceiling", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "HealthRIGHT360 · File 140748", "heading": "Five-year contract ceilings", "source": "f140748b", "rows": [